Package: SyncER
Title: Synchronicity testing for Event Records
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Katleen", "Wils", email = "katleen.wils@ugent.be", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides functions for synchronizing age-depth models across
    sediment core records using isochron age constraints, log-ratio
    synchronicity testing, and Bayesian age combination.
